{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 6, "data": [{"docid2": 1567270, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/202009/t20200905_1567270.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：承担突发环境事件应急事故调查处置、信息通报及应急预警；受理12369电话投诉和网上投诉；承担我市生态环境应急与事故调查过程中事务性工作。    \n　　负责人：罗光平   \n　　联系电话：0598-8223791 ", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/202009/t20200905_1567270.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.10 15:53:00", "doctitle": "三明市环境应急与事故调查中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980054, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/202009/t20200905_1567270.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1851069, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/hjbh_28777/202211/t20221126_1851069.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：负责指导全市环境监测工作，开展新三元区重点污染源执法监测和突发环境事件应急监测，开展新三元区排污单位自行监测监督检查，配合完成全市污染源监测质控抽测，开展新三元区农村环境质量等监测工作。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/hjbh_28777/202211/t20221126_1851069.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.15 15:53:17", "doctitle": "三明市环境监测站", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1988161, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/hjbh_28777/202211/t20221126_1851069.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/hjbh_28777/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1287721, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287721.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：负责环保信息网络、污染源监控、网站等系统建设与管理；负责环保信息收集、传输、处理；提供环保管理信息技术支持；组织环保宣教活动；开展环保新闻报道；收集分析环保舆情；制作环保宣教材料；组织实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287721.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.15 15:53:17", "doctitle": "三明市环境保护信息宣传教育中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980057, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287721.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1287722, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287722.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：负责环境规划、环境容量、项目选线选址及规划、环境事故处理技术等公益基础研究；负责生态环境质量控制等方面的应用性技术研究；受委托开展全市固体废物和危险化学品转移、交换、处置以及化学品环境监", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287722.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.15 15:53:17", "doctitle": "三明市环境保护科学研究所", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980055, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287722.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1287723, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287723.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：受委托承担市辖区污染防治、生态保护、核与辐射安全等行政执法和全市相关领域跨区域执法、重大案件查处；承担投诉举报受理，县（市）行政执法业务指导和执法协调等工作。\n　　负责人：林以俊     \n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287723.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.15 15:53:17", "doctitle": "三明市生态环境保护综合执法支队", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980058, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/t20050106_1287723.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/200501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1465961, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境保护", "chnldocurl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/201911/t20191128_1465961.htm", "content": "\n　　主要职责：负责全市储备排污权的收储、出让及排污权有偿使用收入的管理；排污权核定，排污权储备和交易情况的审查和统筹调度；排污权交易业务培训及实施情况评估，对下级储备管理机构进行业务指导；排污权管理与", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/201911/t20191128_1465961.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.15 15:53:17", "doctitle": "三明市排污权储备和技术服务中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980056, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/201911/t20191128_1465961.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://shb.sm.gov.cn/jgjj/sydw/201911/", "rels": []}]}